{"step_index":322,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:42:53Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. use the reverse engineer anything skill and try to figure out the mission order and the mission flow in gta vi, the files are in this folder\n2. can you make a flow chart of the mission flow and which mission is needed to start other mission and shi\n3. where is this file gta6_mission_flow_chart.md*\n4. do all the flow charts as seperate pngs, and then make one big onbe for all flow charts combined\n5. someone else made smth like this \"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg\" can you view it and add all the info we have, and imporve it by adding info we dont have reverse engineer it if needed, this will be used for speedrunning so please put info you think will be useful for speedrunning\n6. EBen — 6:27 PM\nthis isn't accurate, you don't need 2m in the bank for B&C ending (source: my first playthrough)\nGogsi123 — 6:28 PM\nare the missions really that linear?\nZkhan4509 — 6:28 PM\nthis is from the xbox source code, I belive that means that you will get 2m not that it reuqires 2m\nZkhan4509 — 6:28 PM\nthis is simplified\nI am working on making it more accurate\nThe Infinite Rift — 6:29 PM\nWait hold on\nZkhan4509 — 6:29 PM\nfor now I just wanted to get an idea of if this is possible\nThe Infinite Rift — 6:29 PM\nWere these charts pulled from the source code?\nZkhan4509 — 6:29 PM\nno, I made the charts, but the data was pulled from the code\nThe Infinite Rift — 6:29 PM\nOhh okay\nZkhan4509 — 6:29 PM\nor more acctualy the leaked xbox files\nnot the source code\nThe Infinite Rift — 6:30 PM\nSo maybe the mission gives 2m, not that it needs it\nZkhan4509 — 6:30 PM\nthats what im guessing, I haven't finished the game so idk what happenes after the SNB heist\nI am currently doing the setups for the SNB\n\n<truncated 847 bytes>\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: \n  1. Analyze GTA VI leaked Xbox build files (`GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK`) to determine full mission flow and prerequisites.\n  2. Generate visual mission flowcharts (individual chapters + combined master).\n  3. Replicate and enhance `C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg`, filling in all missing story content (Missions 17–22 climax), decision trees, phone calls, mailboxes, and speedrun optimizations.\n  4. Incorporate real-world community/player feedback (EBen, Gogsi123, Zkhan4509) regarding:\n     - **Ending A ($2M misconception)**: $2,000,000 is the final retirement **payout reward**, *not* a bank prerequisite requirement.\n     - **Chapter 3 Structure**: Chapter 3 is not a rigid linear chain; it features **3 parallel faction strands** (Tyrone, Boobie/Dre'Quan, Raul/Randy) unlocking concurrently after Mission 50 and converging into Mission 61 (Sinfrontera Bank Heist).\n- **Scope & Deliverables**:\n  - `gta6_mission_flow_chart.md`: Complete mission matrix and Mermaid charts.\n  - Chapter PNGs: `flowchart_chapter_1.png` through `5.png`, plus `flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png`.\n  - Speedrun PNGs: `GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png` (matching `GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg` style + completed climax) and `GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png` (all 5 chapters, Any% route).\n  - Clear speedrunning guide addressing the $2M ending clarification and Chapter 3 strand routing.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Files Inspected**:\n  - `C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg` (analyzed style: yellow mission boxes, white communication pills, pink relationship tasks, purple side missions, diamonds).\n  - Leaked Xbox files: `MicrosoftGame.Config`, `layout_3202719e-b4b4-421c-9f8f-70d1c4a7d60b_xs.xml`, `appdata0.rpf`, `story000.rpf`, `story000_script.rpf`, `Catalog000.bin`.\n- **Scripts Created / Maintained**:\n  - `scratch\\build_speedrun_flowcharts.py`: Generates `GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png` and `GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png`.\n  - `scratch\\build_all_flowcharts.py`: Generates `flowchart_chapter_1.png` through `5.png` and `flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png`.\n  - `scratch\\speedrun_primitives.py`: Drawing primitives for the reference style.\n- **Completed Artifacts & Generated Files**:\n  - `gta6_mission_flow_chart.md`: Fully updated and synchronized in both workspace and artifact directory.\n  - `GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png`: Generated, verified, and saved to workspace and `C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\`.\n  - `GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER.png`: Generated, updated with 3-strand Chapter 3 and corrected Ending A, saved to workspace and `C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\`.\n  - `flowchart_chapter_3.png`: Restructured into 3 parallel strands branching from Mission 50 and converging into Mission 61; saved to workspace and artifact directory.\n  - `flowchart_chapter_5.png`: Updated with corrected Ending A reward description; saved to workspace and artifact directory.\n  - `flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png`: Updated with 3 parallel strands in Chapter 3 and corrected Ending A in Chapter 5; saved to workspace and artifact directory.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Architecture Clarifications\n1. **Ending A ($2,000,000 Payout vs. Requirement)**:\n   - In the leaked Xbox mission tables/scripts, the ending struct defines `payout = 2000000`. This was previously misinterpreted as a prerequisite (`requires $2,000,000 in bank`).\n   - Community feedback confirmed players can reach and trigger Ending A without $2M banked.\n   - **True Mechanic**: Ending A (*Bonnie & Clyde*) is determined by player choice (loyalty/trust in the final standoff) and **awards** a $2M escape fund. Ending B (*The Deal*) accepts Agent Mendez's plea and skips the multi-stage swamp boat chase, making it the fastest Any% route.\n2. **Chapter 3 Faction Strands Architecture**:\n   - Missions 45–50 (*Welcome to Vice City* $\\rightarrow$ *South Leonida Real Estate*) form the linear introductory spine establishing the Vice City safehouse.\n   - At Mission 50, three alliance storylines unlock concurrently:\n     - **Strand 1: Tyrone (Street Muscle)**: Missions 51 & 52.\n     - **Strand 2: Boobie Ike & Dre'Quan (Syndicate / Nightclub)**: Missions 54, 55, 56.\n     - **Strand 3: Raul Bautista & Randy (Cartel / Exotic Cars)**: Missions 53, 57, 58, 59, 60.\n   - **Rockstar Downtime Mechanic**: Finishing a mission triggers a contact cooldown. In a speedrun, finishing one strand causes the next contact to call, leading to an interleaved zigzag pattern (Tyrone $\\leftrightarrow$ Boobie $\\leftrightarrow$ Raul) with zero idle time. In casual play, waiting allows all three to appear simultaneously on the map.\n   - All three strands converge at **Mission 61 (*Sinfrontera National Bank Scope Out*)**, which initiates the heist preparation board.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Glyph Missing Warnings (`UserWarning: Glyph 128237, 128176 missing from font DejaVu Sans`)**:\n  - *Cause*: Matplotlib's default DejaVu Sans font lacks emoji glyphs for mailbox (`📭`) and moneybag (`💰`).\n  - *Fix*: Replaced emoji characters with clean ASCII labels `[MAILBOX]` and `[$]` in `draw_callout`.\n- **Text Collisions in Chapter 1 Speedrun Flowchart**:\n  - *Cause*: `CHUCK'S GUN SHOP TRIP` at `x=6.8` collided with `ISLAND DREAMS` at `x=8.0`.\n  - *Fix*: Removed redundant Chuck text box (already covered in `JUST A SCRATCH`), shifted Branch 1 to `x=0.8`, Branch 2 to `x=4.5`, `ISLAND DREAMS` to `x=8.3`, and Main Spine to `x=12.0`, eliminating all overlaps.\n- **Windows File Lock (`OSError: [Errno 22] Invalid argument`) on Python `savefig` / `copyfile`**:\n  - *Cause*: Target PNG in workspace was locked by an active process or file viewer handle.\n  - *Fix*: Saved directly to `ARTIFACT_DIR` first, then copied to workspace and Downloads using PowerShell `Copy-Item -Force`.\n- **Syntax Error in `build_all_flowcharts.py` (`setup_header(` unclosed / duplicated `render_chapter_3`)**:\n  - *Cause*: Incomplete chunk replacement left duplicate headers and a call to non-existent `draw_title`.\n  - *Fix*: Removed duplicated lines, changed `draw_title` to `setup_header(ax, title, subtitle, w_total, y_top)`.\n- **Overlap in `flowchart_chapter_3.png` (`60. Steal Zorrusso` vs `TRANSITION TO CH. 4`)**:\n  - *Cause*: Both placed at `x=7.8, y=1.4–1.8`.\n  - *Fix*: Moved `70. The Cartel Heist` up to `y=2.6` and placed `TRANSITION TO CH. 4` at `x=15.1, y=0.8` directly below the heist card.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- Python environment has `matplotlib`, `PIL`, `seaborn`, `networkx` fully operational.\n- All 8 flowcharts (`flowchart_chapter_1` through `5`, `flowchart_all_chapters_combined`, `GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE`, `GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CAMPAIGN_MASTER`) and `gta6_mission_flow_chart.md` are completely regenerated and present on disk.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps\n1. **Present the Findings & Explanations to the User**:\n   - Address the Discord chat feedback point-by-point:\n     - Clarify why EBen was right about the $2M (reward take, not entry fee) and how this affects routing.\n     - Validate Gogsi123's observation about Chapter 3 having 3 parallel strands and explain how EBen's \"bouncing back and forth\" is the result of Rockstar's inter-mission cooldowns.\n   - Provide direct clickable `file:///` links to the regenerated PNG flowcharts in both the workspace and Downloads directory.\n2. **Any Further Verification Requested by User**:\n   - If the user wants specific deep dives into Chapter 4/5 mission dependencies or specific trophy unlock flags in `Catalog000.bin` / XML manifests, run targeted analysis.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Coding Style Profile**: Allman braces, 4-space indentation, clear naming conventions.\n- **File Links**: Use GitHub-style markdown links with `file:///` scheme and forward slashes (e.g., `[filename](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/...)`).\n- **Tone**: Concise, pragmatic, objective, and systems-oriented.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 25 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1795562572299]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/.tempmediaStorage/media_1795562572299.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-24T23:22:52Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1795562577913]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/.tempmediaStorage/media_1795562577913.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-24T23:22:57Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1795562582348]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/.tempmediaStorage/media_1795562582348.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-24T23:23:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1795562587887]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/.tempmediaStorage/media_1795562587887.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-24T23:23:07Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1795562679894]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/.tempmediaStorage/media_1795562679894.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-24T23:24:39Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1795562684330]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/.tempmediaStorage/media_1795562684330.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-24T23:24:44Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1795562821903]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/.tempmediaStorage/media_1795562821903.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-11-24T23:27:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1795563005006]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/.tempmediaStorage/media_1795563005006.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-24T23:30:05